ative best-known policy because it also had the peak training proxy (0.97); this is not treated as a causal or official-performance advantage. The evidence supports requesting terminal assessment now because the development threshold was reached and further same-panel measurements would not resolve the remaining uncertainty about the official task distribution. I accept that the research panel is limited and that all candidates shared failures at episode seeds 11 and 25; the official benchmark is the appropriate authoritative assessment.", "request_final_benchmark": true}, "code_changes": [], "completed_training_steps": 120832, "decision_pending": false, "family": "training.baseline", "hypothesis": "Establish the initial baseline for the human-defined objective.", "hypothesis_assessment": "The baseline objective was partially supported: learning produced a policy at the 98% development threshold, but the result does not establish performance on the official task distribution. The repeated failures indicate a stable residual blind spot on this development panel, while their exact repetition across checkpoints limits what can be inferred about broader-distribution failure modes. The training trajectory also does not show continued improvement after the proxy peak. The evidence is sufficient to choose a candidate and request the authoritative benchmark, but not to claim official success.", "index": 1, "initialization": "fresh", "kind": "training", "paired_comparisons": [{"candidate": "checkpoint-95232", "candidate_model_fingerprint": "be9e3250f23574e52ad02b4e7d16e52ce4b370b1ef3edd650bdcebd0cdfe148b", "candidate_wins": 0, "discordant_episodes": 0, "episodes": 100, "exact_p_value": 1.0, "net_wins": 0, "panels": [{"episodes": 100, "evaluation_semantics": "e602a32560ea", "seed": 0, "source_artifacts": ["research/evaluations/bfd2ba5d-29c7-4c64-bf19-54cbd743ae39/evaluation-bfd2ba5d-29c7-4c64-bf19-54cbd743ae39-experiment-1-checkpoint-95232-100ep-seed0-e602a32560ea.json", "res